---
layout: refonte
title: Interventions
permalink: /refonte/interventions/
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav aria-label="Fil d'Ariane">
      <ol class="breadcrumb">
        <li><a href="/refonte/">Accueil</a></li>
        <li aria-current="page">Interventions</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <p class="kicker">Conférences, formations</p>
    <h1>Mes <em>interventions</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Conférences, formations et ateliers autour de l'accessibilité numérique,
      de l'IA et de la qualité web — depuis 2010.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <ul class="interventions-grid">
      {% for post in collections.interventions | reverse %}
      <li>
        <a class="card-intervention" href="/refonte/intervention/{{ post.fileSlug }}/">
          <div class="card-intervention__image">
            {% if post.data.image %}
            <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
            {% endif %}
            <span class="card-intervention__year">{{ post.data.date.getFullYear() }}</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="card-intervention__title">{{ post.data.title | e }}</h2>
          {% if post.data.description %}
          <p class="card-intervention__desc">{{ post.data.description | truncate(140) }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
